        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Textile, trousers (paijama), pink silk, gold and silver brocade, Bharatpur, ca. 1855"@en , "Trousers, dark pink silk, brocaded with gold-wrapped and silver-wrapped thread in alternate stripes with scrolling plant designs, red silk ties, the tassels bound with gold-wrapped thread."@en , "Intended for use as a garment, clothing. Slip book notes that the entire outfit was 'used for ceremonial purposes'."@en ;
